=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data sources (web useTranslation + useUnits): useTranslation -> the P1/S10
    SummarySlideStrings facade; useUnits().unitPrefs.distance -> the model's
    `distanceUnit: DistanceDisplayUnit` (prod app feeds it from the shared units
    holder). The web `data: YearReview` prop -> the P1/S8 YearReviewSource seam +
    a web-prop convenience init `SummarySlide(data:)`. No HTTP in the view.
  - Composition (web gradient card + AnimatedNumber stats + savings + captions):
      • Card        -> TSGlassPanel material card (web `motion.div` glass card),
                       max-width 420, centered (web items-center justify-center).
      • Header      -> year (Font.TS.title) + "Year in Review" + vehicle name/model
                       (web flex justify-between block), rendered verbatim.
      • Stats       -> the 5 web rows IN ORDER (drives, distance, energy, charges,
                       CO₂), each = SF-Symbol icon (Lucide map) + TSAnimatedNumber
                       (data-display, reduce-motion aware) + label, cascaded via
                       TSStaggerContainer/TSStaggerItem (motion) like the web per-
                       index motion delay.
      • Distance    -> convertDistanceFromSI(total_distance_km * 1000, unit) (web
                       line verbatim: SI km -> metre floor -> display unit); label is
                       the unit itself (km/mi/ft), exactly as web renders unitPrefs.distance.
      • Savings     -> shown only when gas_savings > 0 (web conditional); emerald
                       "💰 Saved $<amount> vs. gas" via the localized template
                       (web default `Saved ${{amount}} vs. gas`).
      • Captions    -> brand line "TeslaSync • Year in Review" + the share hint
                       "📸 Screenshot to share your year!" (web `t('yearReview.screenshot')`).
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a resolver unit test):
      loading (skeleton card) · empty (zero-activity review -> friendly
      ContentUnavailableView, never a blank card) · content (the recap card) ·
      stale (freshness chip + auto-refresh) · offline (cached card + offline chip,
      or offline-no-data state with retry) · error (QueryError-equivalent + retry).
  - i18n (P1/S10): web keys preserved verbatim — yearReview.title / totalDrives /
    energyKwh / charges / co2KgSaved / screenshot / savedSummary; native chrome
    namespaced yearReview.summary.* (live/stale/offline/refresh/retry/loading/
    empty.title/empty.message/errorTitle/offlineMessage) + yearReview.brandLine.
    Every code-referenced key is declared in SummarySlide.strings (referenced ⊆
    declared verified); NO English string literals in native code (all via the
    SummarySlideStrings facade + Text(verbatim:)).
  - Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every element — header (combined year +
    vehicle), each stat row (combined "value label", icon hidden), savings line,
    freshness chip, refresh + retry buttons; the card carries a contained summary;
    Dynamic-Type system fonts (Font.TS); reduce-motion honored (TSAnimatedNumber +
    TSFadeIn/TSStagger + TSSkeleton shimmer).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): SummarySlide emits view.opened with surface slug
    "SummarySlide" on .task (DashboardWidgetTelemetrySink; prod app injects the
    shared diagnostics adapter, tests use BufferedDashboardWidgetTelemetry).

